But Ryan Levy says, how would, Ryan Levy says, how would you reflect on the beat up a girl comment at the end felt like a pretty diabolical punchline to me.
但瑞安·利维（Ryan Levy）说，瑞安·利维说，你对结尾处“揍女孩”的那句台词有什么感想，我觉得这听起来像是一个非常恶毒的包袱。

00:29:06.660 --> 00:29:10.180
Yeah, I don't I don't love it.
